{
  "id": 224745421,
  "iid": 10664,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "blf: don't assume that app text is null-terminated in the file.",
  "description": "When reading the text from an app text message, allocate a buffer one\nbyte larger than the size of the message, and set that byte to '\\0'\nafter reading the message text, to ensure that the text is\nnull-terminated and can be safely handed to routines that process C\nstrings.\n\nFixes #19084.",
